{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Cute and Therapeutic House Sticker Game</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your dream room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No time limits, no energy restrictions. Start and quit at your leisure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this Demo, there will be 3 modes and 5 levels opening gradually</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Please look forward to the version updates</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Target Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drag and drop furniture to the designated positions. <i>Enjoy the simple, stress-relieving fun of dragging.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091900/extras/8760102729890c67beb85ad3990132a7.poster.avif?t=1760899322\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091900/extras/8760102729890c67beb85ad3990132a7.webm?t=1760899322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091900/extras/8760102729890c67beb85ad3990132a7.mp4?t=1760899322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Free Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Freely place and flip the furniture. <i>Drag and drop at will, unrestricted placement</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091900/extras/bdede6d4497f84c5b4a0a2c731988047.poster.avif?t=1760899322\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https: